Tests: include gnuradio-4.0/Graph.hpp explicitly

blocks/basic/test/qa_Converters.cpp, blocks/channel/test/qa_Converters.cpp
and blocks/sigmf/test/qa_SigMfSource.cpp all use gr::Graph without
including its header, relying on it arriving transitively through
another gnuradio-4.0 header. gnuradio4-core's headers were made
self-sufficient (each installed header can now be included on its
own), which dropped that transitive include and leaves gr::Graph an
incomplete type here, breaking the build. Include Graph.hpp directly.

Upstream-Status: Pending

